# Build context for backend/Dockerfile is the REPO ROOT (docker-compose.qa.yml),
# so backend/.dockerignore never applied: the macOS venv, coverage data and any
# dev SQLite ledger (real rows, phone numbers) were baked into the image.
.git
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/.dev-backup/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/build/
ios/
media/
docs/
deploy/certs/
.env
.env.*
!deploy/.env.qa.example
